# Build & make live

After any change that affects the player app (games code, assets under `public/`, styles, registry), always finish by deploying:

```bash
cd /var/www/zee9 && npm run build && systemctl reload nginx
```

Verify with:

```bash
curl -s -o /dev/null -w "%{http_code}\n" https://zee9.roadmaster.pro/
```

Do this every time — do not leave changes only in the source tree or Vite dev server.
Live root is `/var/www/zee9/dist` via nginx (`zee9.roadmaster.pro`).
